.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    See where keeper-test stances sit against last finalized position ratings — best toward the top right, worst toward the bottom left.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    This is the same private Talent Density data as Stances. Nobody ever sees their own marker. Hover a marker for who recorded the keeper stance and who finalized the last position rating.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li X-axis is the six position check-in statuses, worst on the left.
    %li Y-axis is the three keeper responses, worst at the bottom.
    %li Switch Dots vs Names without changing filters. Use Filters to pick manager, directs vs full hierarchy, and people to exclude. Filters are shared with Guidance+Rating Matrix.
    %li People missing a keeper stance or a finalized position rating are listed under the grid, not plotted.
